  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the octane number of gasoline fuel, which contains <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>25%</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>n-heptane</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r and <math><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math> is <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>iso-octane</mtext></mrow>\r</math>.",
